  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the binchotan grill according to manufacturer's instructions.",
    "Grate the carrots, parsnips, and potatoes, and set aside.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the chopped onion, minced garlic, soffritto, red chilli powder, salt, caraway seeds, and black pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a pan over medium heat and sauté the onion mixture for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the grated vegetables to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and grill on the binchotan grill for 20 minutes, or until lightly charred.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Portion the hash into individual servings and refrigerate or freeze for meal prep."
